<title>USA: CCC buys 42,778 T U.S. HRW wheat for Georgia.</title>
<headline>CCC buys 42,778 T U.S. HRW wheat for Georgia.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commodity Credit Corp said it bought 42,778 tonnes of U.S. hard red winter wheat under the export donation program to Georgia.</p>
<p>The wheat was acquired from ADM at $179.70 a tonne, FOB, Galveston, Texas. The total value of the sale was $7,687,206.</p>
<p>The CCC is part of the U.S. Department of Agriculture.</p>
<p>--Doris Frankel 312-983-7305</p>
